  "id_str": "1945158231321706896",
  "text": "When models start reasoning step-by-step, we suddenly get a huge safety gift: a window into their thought process.\n\nWe could easily lose this if we're not careful.\n\nWe're publishing a paper urging frontier labs: please don't train away this monitorability.\n\nAuthored and endorsed https://t.co/uOOT8ihTak",
