    "id_str": "1945151391674057154",
    "text": "A simple AGI safety technique: AI’s thoughts are in plain English, just read them\n\nWe know it works, with OK (not perfect) transparency!\n\nThe risk is fragility: RL training, new architectures, etc threaten transparency\n\nExperts from many orgs agree we should try to preserve it: https://t.co/nkPWfNMgAJ",
